# Native shell build output — tools/build_shell_payload.py writes the
# payload here and a simulator build puts the .app beside it. Together
# that is ~230MB, most of it a SECOND copy of the course audio, and this
# repository is already near the Pages size limit. Added 2026-10-05, the
# first time anything was actually built, when `git status` showed the
# whole lot untracked and one `git add -A` from being committed.
/build/
